# SPA fallback for Cloudflare Pages.
#
# Client-side routes such as /privacy must return index.html rather than 404, or
# a refresh on a deep link breaks. The 200 rewrite serves the document without
# the browser seeing a redirect, so the URL in the address bar stays correct.
#
# Only ONE dynamic rewrite is needed, and Cloudflare supports rewrites (status
# 200) while other rewrite status codes are unsupported. /api/* deliberately has
# no rule: uploads go to the API origin directly, so a same-origin /api request
# is a misconfiguration and falling through to the SPA shell is the honest
# signal that the URL is not being proxied here.
#
# This file ships from public/ into dist/. Vite does not process it.
/*  /index.html  200